@* Kóði / Hluthafaskrá project detail *@
<link rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/css/project.css")" />
<div class="project project-detail">
    <h2 class="detail-title">Hluthafaskrá</h2>
    <partial name="_ProjectCarousel" model="@("hluthafaskra")" />
    <div class="detail-description">
        <div class="project-text">
            <p>From January -> August of 2025 I worked for Kóði ehf., assisting with the development of Hluthafaskrá.is. I learned a lot about web development during the 8 months I worked there, most of which was spent on adding new features for their shareholder meeting software. I got to spend time implementing both the frontend and backend of the features that I was implementing, allowing me to get pretty good at SQL, C#, HTML/CSS, and the .Net/Razor based framework.</p>
            <p>I was able to utilize the skills I gained from this position to create the very website you are currently on :)</p>
            <div class="project-logos">
                <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/kodi-logo.png")" alt="Kóði ehf. logo" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <partial name="_ProjectGallery" model="@("hluthafaskra")" />
</div>
